---
<div id="cookie-banner" class="cookie" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="cookie-title" aria-modal="false" hidden>
  <strong id="cookie-title">Your privacy choices</strong>
  <p class="muted" style="margin:.4rem 0 0">
    We would like to count visits and clicks (no advertising, no third parties) to improve the product. Essential storage is always on.
    <a href="/legal/cookies">Cookie policy</a>.
  </p>
  <div class="row">
    <button class="btn" type="button" data-accept>Allow analytics</button>
    <button class="btn secondary" type="button" data-reject>Only essential</button>
  </div>
</div>
